---
import Page from '../../components/Page.astro';
import SubMenuStatement from '../../components/SubMenuStatement.astro';
const links = [
  { label: 'Mission & Guidelines', href: '/what-we-fund/mission-guidelines/' },
  { label: 'Early Grades Achievement', href: '/what-we-fund/early-grades-achievement/' },
  { label: 'Educators & Leaders', href: '/what-we-fund/educators-leaders/' },
  { label: 'Our Grantees', href: '/what-we-fund/our-grantees/' },
];
---
<Page title="What We Fund" section="fund" image="/images/banner-what-we-fund.svg" alt="Illustration of young students outdoors with a teacher">
  <p>The Wexmoor Foundation invests in public education, and we are committed to supporting programs that deliver measurable results for students in North Carolina. Our two focus areas, <strong>early grades achievement</strong> and <strong>excellent educators and leaders</strong>, are among the most reliable ways to set children on a path to success.</p>
  <p>We are always looking for partners who share our goals and for programs that advance our mission.</p>
  <SubMenuStatement links={links} statement="Children who read on grade level by the end of third grade are far more likely to finish high school, and no school factor matters more to their learning than an excellent teacher." />
</Page>
